          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloudに残っている記録の削除と、他の端末への影響を確認しました" : {
      "comment" : "Acknowledgement toggle before starting iCloud from this iPhone deletes the records left in iCloud",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I understand the records remaining in iCloud will be deleted and how this affects other devices"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloudに残っている記録の削除と、他の端末への影響を確認しました"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloudのデータが別の記録に置き換えられています。この端末の記録を送らないよう同期を止めています。" : {
      "comment" : "Launch: iCloud's data was replaced from another device",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your iCloud data has been replaced with different records. Sync has been stopped so this device's records aren't sent."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloudのデータが別の記録に置き換えられています。この端末の記録を送らないよう同期を止めています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloudのデータでこの端末を置き換える" : {
      "comment" : "Settings section title: the iCloud → device direction, which deletes this device's data",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Replace This Device's Data with iCloud's"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloudのデータでこの端末を置き換える"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloudのデータでこの端末を置き換える手続きを受け付けました。Appスイッチャーでポモジェムを終了し、もう一度開いてください。iCloudのデータは削除しません。" : {
      "comment" : "Relaunch screen after the iCloud → device replacement was accepted",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your request to replace this device's data with iCloud's has been accepted. Close PomoGem in the App Switcher and open it again. Your iCloud data will not be deleted."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloudのデータでこの端末を置き換える手続きを受け付けました。Appスイッチャーでポモジェムを終了し、もう一度開いてください。iCloudのデータは削除しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloudのデータとこのiPhoneの記録の対応を確認できないため、記録が混ざらないよう同期を止めています。このiPhoneの記録もiCloudのデータも削除していません。" : {
      "comment" : "Why sync is stopped: iCloud's data and this iPhone's records cannot be matched",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app can't confirm that your iCloud data and this iPhone's records belong together, so sync has been stopped to keep them from getting mixed up. This iPhone's records and your iCloud data have not been deleted."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
